# Showing the explorer takes 224 pixels off the text, and a caret that was in view must
# stay in it: a line of 100 characters with the caret at its end is in view in 111
# columns, not in the 83 that are left (85, less 2 at the edge), so the text scrolls
# 100 - 83 + 1 = 18 columns.
# frames 4
# expect scrollx 18
1 text 0123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678901234567890123456789
2 key b ctrl
